---
layout: base.njk
title: Home Recovery & Sleep Wellness Guides
description: Research-based reviews and guides on red light therapy, recovery tech, and sleep wellness gear for home use.
permalink: /
---
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Recovery &amp; Sleep, Considered</p>
    <h1>Recover better. Sleep better. Spend smarter.</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ site.description }}</p>
    <div class="hero-badges">
      <span>Independently researched</span>
      <span>No sponsored placements</span>
      <span>Updated regularly</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<ul class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.posts %}
  <li class="post-card">
    <div class="post-card-meta">
      {% if post.data.category %}<span class="category-pill">{{ post.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="post-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }} · {{ post.templateContent | readingTime }}</span>
    </div>
    <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>

<div class="trust-strip">
  <span><strong>Evidence-first</strong> We link to studies where they exist and say plainly when they don't.</span>
  <span><strong>Independent</strong> Reviews aren't for sale — brands don't see or approve copy before publishing.</span>
</div>
